[{"id":"linux-a12-route-choice","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["进阶路线","选择"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>发现脚本跨环境行为不一致时，为什么不应直接修改生产脚本？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先固定解释器、输入和最小复现，再判断是 POSIX/Bash、locale、包提供者还是交互环境差异。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先把差异收敛成可复现样例：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shell=%s flags=%s locale=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$0\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;$-&quot;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$&#123;LC_ALL-&lt;unset&gt;&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> -v bash sh awk\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;one two&#x27;\u003c/span> | awk \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&#123; print NF &#125;&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>然后逐项判断是解释器扩展、locale、工具提供者还是交互上下文。兼容模式只能帮助定位，不能替代目标环境的测试；生产脚本要在变更前保留旧版本、输入样本和回滚步骤。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a5-redirection-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["重定向","标准流"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>2&gt;&amp;1 &gt;file 和 &gt;file 2&gt;&amp;1 为什么结果不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>重定向按从左到右执行；前者让错误流先指向旧的标准输出，后者让错误流跟随新文件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>重定向是按从左到右执行的文件描述符操作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> 2&gt;&amp;1 &gt;out.log   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 先让 stderr 跟随旧 stdout，再把 stdout 改到文件\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> &gt;out.log 2&gt;&amp;1   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 先改 stdout，再让 stderr 复制到同一文件\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>第一种写法的错误仍可能出现在终端，第二种才会把两个流都写进 \u003ccode>out.log\u003c/code>。把重定向当作“当前 fd 指向谁”的状态变化，就不会把两种写法当成纯文本顺序。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-02-order-schema-ddl-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["DDL","外键","CHECK","ShopLab"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(二)数据库基础与表设计.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(二)数据库基础与表设计","articlePath":"posts/54906a1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(二)数据库基础与表设计.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(二)数据库基础与表设计","articlePath":"posts/54906a1/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>请为订单系统设计 DDL：订单包含多个商品，库存不能为负，订单状态只能是 pending、paid、cancelled，并且重复 SKU 必须被拒绝。关键表和约束如何写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">14\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">15\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">16\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">17\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">18\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">19\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">20\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">21\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">22\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">23\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">24\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">25\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">26\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">27\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">28\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">29\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">30\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">31\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> users (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span> AUTO_INCREMENT,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  email \u003cspan class=\"type\">VARCHAR\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">255\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UNIQUE\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  display_name \u003cspan class=\"type\">VARCHAR\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">80\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> products (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span> AUTO_INCREMENT,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  sku \u003cspan class=\"type\">VARCHAR\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">40\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UNIQUE\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  price \u003cspan class=\"type\">DECIMAL\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">12\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CHECK\u003c/span> (price \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> inventory (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  product_id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  quantity \u003cspan class=\"type\">INT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CHECK\u003c/span> (quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOREIGN KEY\u003c/span> (product_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">REFERENCES\u003c/span> products(id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> orders (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span> AUTO_INCREMENT,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  user_id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  status \u003cspan class=\"type\">VARCHAR\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">20\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CHECK\u003c/span> (status \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">IN\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;pending&#x27;\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;cancelled&#x27;\u003c/span>)),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOREIGN KEY\u003c/span> (user_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">REFERENCES\u003c/span> users(id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE TABLE\u003c/span> order_items (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  order_id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  product_id \u003cspan class=\"type\">BIGINT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  quantity \u003cspan class=\"type\">INT\u003c/span> UNSIGNED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CHECK\u003c/span> (quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  unit_price \u003cspan class=\"type\">DECIMAL\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">12\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT NULL\u003c/span>,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  line_total \u003cspan class=\"type\">DECIMAL\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">14\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span> unit_price) STORED,\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PRIMARY KEY\u003c/span> (order_id, product_id),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOREIGN KEY\u003c/span> (order_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">REFERENCES\u003c/span> orders(id),\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOREIGN KEY\u003c/span> (product_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">REFERENCES\u003c/span> products(id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) ENGINE \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> InnoDB;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>建表顺序来自外键依赖：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">users ───────┐\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">             ├─ orders ── order_items ── products\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">products ────┘          inventory ──────┘\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>DECIMAL\u003c/code> 保存金额，生成列避免重复计算，主键和唯一键保证身份，外键保证引用存在；它们解决的是不同问题：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>输入\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>预期证据\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>重复 \u003ccode>sku\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>UNIQUE\u003c/code> 冲突\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>负库存/金额\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>CHECK\u003c/code> 或类型约束失败\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>不存在的父行\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>外键失败\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>“订单至少有一条明细”跨越订单头和明细表，单靠这组 DDL 不能自动表达，应在同一事务中创建并回读。把商品字段重复写进 \u003ccode>orders\u003c/code> 会破坏规范化，也无法替代数据库约束。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-project-evidence","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["项目实战","证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>三浏览器测试全部通过，是否能证明线上业务一定正常？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能，只能证明指定提交在指定测试环境和浏览器矩阵中通过。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>本地、CI、测试环境和线上是不同证据层。未执行的线上路径必须保持 NOT VERIFIED，不能由 CI 结果推导。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把测试结果按证据层分开，避免把局部绿色扩大成线上保证：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>层级\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>能证明\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不能证明\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>本地 E2E\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前环境的用户旅程\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>线上依赖正常\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CI 矩阵\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>指定提交和浏览器组合通过\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>未执行的线上路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>线上验证\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当时的线上信号\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>所有用户永不失败\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-k-vs-m","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["选择器"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>-k\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>-m\u003c/code> 分别按什么选择测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>-k\u003c/code> 按 Node ID 的名称表达式匹配，\u003ccode>-m\u003c/code> 按已注册标记匹配；两者都应结合收集数量核对范围。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>-k\u003c/code> 在已收集节点的名称表达式上做大小写不敏感匹配，适合临时定位；\u003ccode>-m\u003c/code> 只看已经注册的 marker，适合稳定的套件分类。两者筛选的对象不同：测试函数名里出现 \u003ccode>slow\u003c/code>，并不会自动拥有 \u003ccode>slow\u003c/code> 标记。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest --collect-only -q -k \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;discount and not integration&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest --markers\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">python -m pytest -q -m \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;smoke and not slow&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先用 \u003ccode>--collect-only\u003c/code> 核对数量和 Node ID，再执行选择命令；若 \u003ccode>-m\u003c/code> 没有结果，先检查标记注册和拼写，不要把空集合误判成测试通过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-object-mutability","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","可变性","别名","增量赋值"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>a = b = []\u003c/code> 容易出错？\u003ccode>+=\u003c/code> 为什么有时会影响别名？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>两个名称开始时指向同一列表；可变对象的 \u003ccode>+=\u003c/code> 往往原地修改，所以别名也能看到变化。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>赋值只复制引用关系，不复制对象；\u003ccode>+=\u003c/code> 是否原地修改取决于对象的可变性：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">a = b = []\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">a += [\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(a, b, a \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> b)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [1] [1] True\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">x = y = \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">x += \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;b&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(x, y, x \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> y)   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># ab a False\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>列表、字典、集合和 \u003ccode>bytearray\u003c/code> 可以原地改，所以别名能观察到变化；字符串、整数和元组不可变，运算通常创建新对象并只重新绑定左侧名称。遇到意外共享，先检查 \u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 和对象类型，再决定复制或重新设计所有权。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-error-else-finally","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","异常","try","else","finally"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>try\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>except\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>else\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>finally\u003c/code> 的职责分别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>try 放可能失败的最小代码，except 处理预期错误，else 在无异常时运行，finally 总会运行以完成清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>四个子句分别承担不同边界：\u003ccode>try\u003c/code> 只包住可能失败的最小操作，\u003ccode>except\u003c/code> 转换已知错误，\u003ccode>else\u003c/code> 放成功后的逻辑，\u003ccode>finally\u003c/code> 负责无论成败都要做的清理。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">try\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    value = parse(raw)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">except\u003c/span> ValueError \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> error:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    record_invalid(raw, error)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">else\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    save(value)       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 这里的异常不会被上面的 except 误捕\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">finally\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    release_buffer()  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 成功、失败、return 都会执行\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>把成功路径放进 \u003ccode>else\u003c/code> 能避免把 \u003ccode>save()\u003c/code> 自己的异常误判为输入解析失败。\u003ccode>finally\u003c/code> 不应随意 \u003ccode>return\u003c/code> 或抛出新错误遮盖原异常；文件、锁和事务通常优先交给 \u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 管理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-upload-resume","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","上传","恢复"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>文件上传暂停、断线后恢复如何验证？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖上传中暂停、网络断开恢复、取消后恢复非法和成功后重复提交，并用字节摘要验证文件完整性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>教学夹具固定分片大小和文件摘要。暂停后恢复应从正确偏移继续，断线重连不重复写入；取消后再恢复应被拒绝并清理临时分片；成功后重复提交按规则去重或生成新版本。检查状态、已传字节、最终摘要、权限和临时文件，切后台或关闭页面重新打开属于追问，不应假设自动恢复。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a06-concept-3","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["用例粒度","检查点"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(六)功能测试用例设计","articlePath":"posts/cd81672d/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多个检查点什么时候应该合并，什么时候应该拆开？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>只有检查点共享前置、目标和失败解释且失败后仍能定位时才合并；独立风险或独立清理通常应拆开。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>登录成功后同时检查页面账号名、会话主体和审计记录，可以保留在同一业务目标下，但预期要逐项列出。若“错误密码被拒绝”和“锁定账户被拒绝”需要不同数据、风险或责任，拆成两条更容易复跑和统计。用例粒度应服务失败隔离、证据诊断和维护成本，而不是追求固定条数。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]